{/* No wrapper elements here. Webflow parses every Embed on its own and closes
    any element left open at the end of one, so a section split across Embeds
    must be made of complete top-level pieces: the header, one wrapper per card,
    the tail spacer. The section > container > #gh-why-stack wrapper those pieces
    live in is built at runtime by assembleWhyStack() in the first script. */}
